{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/lib/bundle/trust.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-14T03:56:44.443540Z","id":"01dfd17f5af82d8954ea7e6ce56073e1c49306d39c3f9f11ae8686fa265ff4fa","body":{"detail":"§6.4 of docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-13-flutter-app-bundles-design.md asks update to carry modified from §5.4, which needs the live version's content_sha256 and capabilities; the lineage store does not hold them. decide therefore takes an optional named live: {aid: ReleaseState}. The caller fetches the live state of local apps whose entry has the bundle's lineage (GET /api/artifacts/<aid>) and passes it; an app missing from live counts as modified, so the sheet offers 'Update (replaces your changes)' rather than silently replacing changes.","kind":"comment","span":{"start":{"line":56},"end":{"line":112},"content_hash":"405021f6c18de569a9ca2ab9953c6cae2d2fcf759d16f1038a65abc33e7b7752"},"summary":"decide takes a live map beyond the spec's decide(bundle, store, ownKey)","tags":["session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
